Frank de Boer (gumelar 15 1970; umur 56 taun) mangrupa saurang urut pa&lt;a href="ma%C3%A9n%20bal"&gt;maén bal&lt;/a&gt; kabangsaan &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;. Anjeunna pernah gawé (maén) keur &lt;a href="Ajax%20Amsterdam"&gt;Ajax Amsterdam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="FC%20Barcelona"&gt;FC Barcelona&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Galatasaray"&gt;Galatasaray&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rangers%20F.C."&gt;Rangers F.C.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Al-Rayyan"&gt;Al-Rayyan&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Al-Shamal"&gt;Al-Shamal&lt;/a&gt;. Di timnas, nyitak 13 gol ti 112 partéy.
