<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Izu%20no%20Odoriko"&gt;Izu no Odoriko&lt;/a&gt; (Tukang Ibing Izu jeung carita-carita lianna) (&lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt;).</li>
