<doc id="35892" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=35892" title="Eddie Murphy">
Eddie Murphy

Edward Regan Murphy atawa leuwih dipikawanoh Eddie Murphy (gumelar di &lt;a href="Brooklyn"&gt;Brooklyn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sarikat"&gt;Amérika Sarikat&lt;/a&gt;, 3 1961; umur 65 taun).Karir salaku komédian dimimitian nalika lalaki turunan &lt;a href="Amerika"&gt;Amerika&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt; ieu nalika umurna 13 taun, babarengan jeung babaturanana &lt;a href="Mitchell%20Kyser"&gt;Mitchell Kyser&lt;/a&gt;.Ti umur 15 taun Eddie geus boga kamampuh dina widang komik jeung nulis.Satuluyna nalika umurna 19 taun Eddie ngamimitian aktingna dina serial TV &lt;a href="NBC"&gt;NBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saturday%20Night%20Live"&gt;Saturday Night Live&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1975"&gt;1975&lt;/a&gt;,anu ngabalukarkeun ngaranna jadi komédian anu moyan.Murphy dipénta pipirakan ku pamajikanana &lt;a href="Nicole%20Mitchell"&gt;Nicole Mitchell&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="17%20April"&gt;17 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;.Eddie ngaliwatan serial komédi &lt;a href="Beverly%20Hills%20Cop"&gt;Beverly Hills Cop&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Trading%20Places"&gt;Trading Places&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="The%20Nutty%20Professor"&gt;The Nutty Professor&lt;/a&gt; suksés ngahontal nominasi &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe"&gt;Golden Globe&lt;/a&gt;, nalika taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; bisa meunangkeun &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe"&gt;Golden Globe&lt;/a&gt; ngaliwatan aktingna dina film Dréamgirls.
Taun &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt; Murphy ngalaman kagagalan dina usahana salaku &lt;a href="sutradara"&gt;sutradara&lt;/a&gt; Harlem Nights. Sabada sababaraha lila, Murphy balik deui jadi aktor komédi anu parigel jeung bisa mekar leuwih loba ti batan saméméhna nepi ka suksés jadi superstar nalika taun &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;-an.Dina film animasi Shrek,manéhna bisa ngaluarkeun pesona anu dipiboga jeung ngirut panongton kana karakter komédina.Tuluy manéhna hadir deui dina Shrek Forever After.
Eddie disebut-sebut pernah papacangan jeung &lt;a href="Melanie%20Brown"&gt;Melanie Brown&lt;/a&gt; salah sahiji anggota &lt;a href="Spice%20Girls"&gt;Spice Girls&lt;/a&gt;, produser &lt;a href="Tracey%20Edmonds"&gt;Tracey Edmonds&lt;/a&gt;, aktris &lt;a href="Halle%20Berry"&gt;Halle Berry&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Tamara%20Moore"&gt;Tamara Moore&lt;/a&gt; nepi ka lahirna &lt;a href="Christian%20Murphy"&gt;Christian Murphy&lt;/a&gt;.
